OL,3,GNEWSASouth's gamers hyped as Grand
OL,4,ATheft Auto 6 released
OL,5,
OL,6,FGamers across the south of England have
OL,7,Fspent the night playing one of the most
OL,8,Fhotly anticipated video games in
OL,9,Fhistory.
OL,11,FGrand Theft Auto (GTA) 6 was released
OL,12,Fin the UK at midnight, with people
OL,13,Fbooking the day off to enjoy driving
OL,14,Fdown the open-world streets of the
OL,15,Ffictional Vice City and break the law.
OL,17,FAfter a 13-year wait, two delays, and
OL,18,Fseveral high-profile leaks, the next
OL,19,Fchapter in the nearly 30-year-old
OL,20,Fseries had created an extraordinary
OL,21,Flevel of anticipation.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
